   "format": "short_answer",
   "stem": {
      "text": "Let h(x) = x sqrt(1 + x^3). Find the exact value of h'(2)."
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "numeric",
      "mathjson": 7
   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "h is a product of x and the composite sqrt(1 + x^3), so h'(x) = sqrt(1 + x^3) + x d/dx[sqrt(1 + x^3)].",
         "mathjson": [
            "Sqrt",
            [
               "Add",
               1,
               [
                  "Power",
                  "x",
                  3
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "By the chain rule, the square root contributes 1/(2 sqrt(1 + x^3)) and the inner function contributes 3x^2, so d/dx[sqrt(1 + x^3)] = 3x^2 / (2 sqrt(1 + x^3)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               3,
               [
                  "Power",
                  "x",
                  2
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Multiply",
               2,
               [
                  "Sqrt",
                  [
                     "Add",
                     1,
                     [
                        "Power",
                        "x",
                        3
                     ]
                  ]
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So h'(x) = sqrt(1 + x^3) + 3x^3 / (2 sqrt(1 + x^3)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Add",
            [
               "Sqrt",
               [
                  "Add",
                  1,
                  [
                     "Power",
                     "x",
                     3
                  ]
               ]
            ],
            [
               "Divide",
               [
                  "Multiply",
                  3,
                  [
                     "Power",
                     "x",
                     3
                  ]
               ],
               [
                  "Multiply",
                  2,
                  [
                     "Sqrt",
                     [
                        "Add",
                        1,
                        [
                           "Power",
                           "x",
                           3
                        ]
                     ]
                  ]
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "At x = 2 the inner expression is 1 + 8 = 9, so h'(2) = 3 + 24/6 = 3 + 4 = 7.",
         "mathjson": 7
      }
   ],
